        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wind turbine 3.4MW, onshore, foundation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wind turbine 3.4MW, onshore, foundation
UUID=08fcf92b-bb35-3e11-8dc3-55e95d6ea79b
Wind turbine foundation, at site including manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.
Data are based on the plant IEA reference 3.4MW onshore wind turbine (Bortolotti et al., 2019; Cooperman et al., 2023).
Assumed lifetime is 25 years.
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_08fcf92b-bb35-3e11-8dc3-55e95d6ea79b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
